  "body": "When moving a SQLite3 DB to PostgreSQL, I encountered a crash of `synapse_port_db`.\r\n\r\n```\r\nroot@2dc5b8149758:/# synapse_port_db --sqlite-database /data/homeserver.db.snapshot --postgres-config /data/homeserver-sqlite.yaml --curses\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/usr/local/bin/synapse_port_db\", line 622, in run\r\n    consumeErrors=True,\r\ntwisted.internet.defer.FirstError: FirstError[#42, [Failure instance: Traceback: <class 'psycopg2.errors.DatatypeMismatch'>: column \"shadow_banned\" is of type boolean but expression is of type integer\r\nLINE 1: ...BvqC', 1600941970, 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0)\r\n\r\n```\r\nThe column datatype doesn't match.\r\n\r\n- Synapse V1.20.0\r\n- Docker\r\n",
